   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive)<br><strong>Enhances:</strong> Popup Melee Weapon (Cyberleg)<br><strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p>Enhances a Popup Melee Weapon in a Cyberleg. The mount will now hold a One-Handed Very Heavy Melee Weapon, concealable or not before it went in, supplied by the user together with whatever attachments and mods it carries. On top of that, a Critical Injury caused by the enhanced weapon against someone the user is grappling carries 5 more bonus damage, 10 in total.</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Cyberlegs).</em></p>"
